### Ephemeral cycle worktrees (AGENTS.md § 3) ###
# Anchored to the repository root on purpose. An unanchored `workspace/` also
# matched the production package `dev.rubentxu.pipeline.v2.domain.workspace`,
# and a rule that swallows source files does it silently: the files already
# tracked stayed tracked, and every new file added to that package vanished
# from `git status` without a word.
/workspace/
/.pipelinek-cycles/

